              </tr>
            </table></td>
        </tr>
        <tr> 
          <td><font size="4" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Fleets/Input 
            Mileage and Collective Events</font></td>
        </tr>
        <tr> 
          <td>&nbsp;</td>
        </tr>
        <tr> 
          <td height="301"> <table width="90%" height="528" border="1" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bordercolor="#3B6692">
              <tr> 
                <td height="526"> <div align="justify"></div>
                  <div align="justify"></div>
                  <div align="justify"> 
                    <table width="90%" border="0" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                      <tr> 
                        <td width="30%" height="178"><img src="/datacenter/util/imgs/mn_menu_10_en.jpg" width="152" height="178"></td>
                        <td width="3%">&nbsp;</td>
                        <td width="67%"><div align="justify"> 
                            <div align="justify"><font size="2" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Here 
                              users can select the fleet for which they will input 
                              collective or individual mileage data for a specific 
                              period. To carry out this action a search is required. 
                              This element can replace the data sent to the CEPA 
                              Data Center by the client Company on a monthly basis. 
                              <br>
                              This application also allows users to input events 
                              reported collectively (events reported by means 
                              other than forms). </font> </div>
                          </div></td>
                      </tr>
                      <tr> 
                        <td height="386" colspan="3"> <p><font size="2" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Description 
                            of the process used to input collective mileage:</font> 
                          </p>
                          <ul>
                            <li> 
                              <div align="justify"><font size="2" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">	
                                Select the name of the fleet (through a search);</font></div>
                            </li>
                            <li> 
                              <div align="justify"><font size="2" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"> 
                                Select the period for which the data will be reported;</font></div>
                            </li>
                            <li> 
                              <div align="justify"><font size="2" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">	
                                Click on the name of the fleet;</font></div>
                            </li>
                            <li> 
                              <div align="justify"><font size="2" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"> 
                                For each Division the user must inform number 
                                of vehicles, mileage, accidents and incidents 
                                for the selected period. Then click on &quot;Save&quot;.</font></div>
                            </li>
                          </ul>
                          <p align="justify"><font size="2" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Description 
                            of the process used to input collective events: On 
                            the same collective mileage input screen, fill in 
                            the fields below with accident and incident data, 
                            including: Division, Classification, Quantity, etc.</font></p>
                          <p><font size="2" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"> 
                            Description of the process to input individual mileage:</font></p>
                          <ul>
                            <li> 
                              <div align="justify"><font size="2" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"> 
                                Select the name of the fleet (through a search); 
                                </font></div>
                            </li>
                            <li> 
                              <div align="justify"><font size="2" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">	
                                Select the period for which the data will be reported;</font></div>
                            </li>
                            <li><font size="2" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"> 
                              Click on the name of the fleet;</font></li>
                            <li> 
                              <div align="justify"><font size="2" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"> 
                                Enter current odometer reading, number of accidents 
                                and incidents for each vehicle.</font></div>
                            </li>
                          </ul></td>
                      </tr>
                    </table>
                  </div></td>
